<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Businesses in today's fast-paced digital world are always looking for methods to improve the customer experience and optimize their processes. Artificial intelligence \(AI\)-powered chatbots are among the best ways for achieving this. Because they provide immediate answers to consumer questions, automate repetitive tasks, and enhance overall customer engagement, chatbots have emerged as a crucial tool for companies across a range of industries.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
151 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Al-Tazaj is a popular fast-food restaurant brand in Saudi Arabia. Known for its fresh and excellent grilled chicken dishes. There is a growing need for effective customer service as the brand expands. Al-Tazaj currently handles client inquiries mostly through conventional channels, including call centers and social media, which might result in inefficiencies and delays. Using a customer service chatbot can help with this problem by decreasing the burden for human agents, improving customer satisfaction, and greatly speeding up response times.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
